<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sort</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sort is a town in the province of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lleida">Lleida</a>, Catalonia, capital of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pallars">Pallars</a> Sobirà district on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/noguera-pallaresa">Noguera Pallaresa</a>. In the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/middle-ages">Middle Ages</a> it was the main seat of the counts of Pallars Sobirà, whose castle ruins stand above the town. Today it is a centre for white-water rafting and canoeing on the river.</p></div>
